previews and hillclimb are this repository's own workflows.

Local changes to Matt Pocock's skills (https://github.com/mattpocock/skills):
skills are named without harness-specific command syntax; grilling asks
settled-prerequisite questions in batches through the interactive question
tool; teach agrees on a workspace before creating learning files inside a
software project; research uses available web tools without nested research
agents; codebase-design and diagnosing-bugs cite current project documentation
instead of a context summary; wizard's pause stops at EOF. resolving-merge-
conflicts was dropped after upstream removed it in daa01d8.

sol-loop is copied unchanged from tstack (https://github.com/t3dotgg/tstack).

